 the people and does not believe in Allāh and the Last Day. His example is like that of a [large] smooth stone upon which is dust and is hit by a downpour that leaves it bare. They are unable [to keep] anything of what they have earned. And Allāh does not guide the disbelieving people.","j":3,"h":5,"s":2,"a":264,"sd":null}],"juz":3,"hizb":5,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}